  <description>
<p>
SoundConverter X is an enhanced audio file converter for the GNOME Desktop.
</p>
<p>
SoundConverter X is a simple to use, fast audio converter with advanced codec controls. It can convert multiple files at the same time to speed up conversion. It can also extract the audio from videos.
</p>
